1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,760
Last connection delayed. Please check the departure board.

2
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:18,660
Anywhere still open? I just need somewhere to sit. I'm waiting for—

3
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:34,090
Try your hotel. There are a few places down the road. Don't know what's open.

4
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:53,090
Just tell me you're somewhere warm. You don't have to explain. Your sister's still up.

5
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:24,760
Kitchen's closed. I can bring you some water.

6
00:01:25,110 --> 00:01:27,370
No. I'll go out.

7
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,810
You said you weren't working. We haven't done the bridge. Jo made the river go uphill.

8
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,400
You asked for a waterfall. That's the waterfall.

9
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:04,830
It goes the other way. See? That's our house.

10
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,550
Mara. She was showing you something.

11
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:25,260
Put your socks on. Please. Just do that for me.

12
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,680
I'm sorry. Save me the bridge, okay? We'll do it together.

13
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,130
When? You said that yesterday.

14
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,830
After my shift. If you're still up for it.

15
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,550
Don't put a road through it.

16
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:06,110
I have to leave at noon. Don't sign up for another shift.

17
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:11,400
It covers Friday's deposit. That's all I'm doing.

18
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,830
I have work, too. I can't call out again.

19
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,260
I'll ask to leave early. I'll call before I leave.

20
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,550
Before noon. Not from the bus.

21
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:48,230
I've still got her down for Friday. Call billing when you get off. The renewal's still denied.

22
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:55,680
I'll call at noon. Can you put that in the notes?

23
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,550
Are we still going on Friday?

24
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,980
That's what I'm trying to sort out.

25
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,830
Come on. Show me which way the water goes.
